---
import GuideLayout from "../layouts/GuideLayout.astro";
import { buildBreadcrumbs } from "../lib/seo";

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: "Home", url: "https://arabiaexpat.com/" },
  { name: "Privacy Policy", url: "https://arabiaexpat.com/privacy-policy/" },
];
---

<GuideLayout
  title="Privacy Policy: Data Collection & Cookie Details 2026"
  description="How we handle visitor data, cookies, Clarity and Google Analytics. No personal data collected through guides or calculators. Updated October 2026. Opt-out."
  canonical="/privacy-policy/"
  schemas={[buildBreadcrumbs(breadcrumbs)]}
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "Privacy Policy", url: "/privacy-policy/" }]}
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy 2026</h1>
  <p><strong>Last updated: October 2026</strong></p>

  <p>Arabia Expat ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit arabiaexpat.com.</p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
  <p>When you visit our website, we may automatically collect certain information about your device and usage patterns, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>IP address (anonymized)</li>
    <li>Browser type and version</li>
    <li>Operating system</li>
    <li>Pages visited and time spent on each page</li>
    <li>Referring website or source</li>
    <li>Device type (desktop, mobile, tablet)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>User-Provided Information</h3>
  <p>If you contact us via email, we may collect the information you voluntarily provide. We do not require registration or collect personal data through our guides or informational content.</p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>We use Microsoft Clarity to understand how visitors interact with our website. Clarity captures anonymized usage data including page views, clicks, and scrolling behavior. Clarity does not collect personally identifiable information. You can learn more about Clarity's data practices at Microsoft's privacy documentation.</p>
  <p>We also use Google Analytics 4, provided by Google Ireland Limited (Google LLC for transfers), loaded when the page opens, without a consent banner. It records the pages you view, where your visit came from, visit duration and engagement, your device type and browser, and your approximate location (country, city) derived from your IP address, which Google Analytics 4 does not store. We use it for audience measurement, on the basis of our legitimate interest in understanding how the site is used. Data is transferred to Google LLC in the United States, which is certified under the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Our website uses the following types of cookies:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> Required for basic website functionality, including your dark mode preference stored in localStorage.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> Used by Microsoft Clarity to analyze website usage patterns. These are loaded after a 3-second delay to prioritize page performance.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics cookies:</strong> <code>_ga</code> (2 years) and <code>_ga_&lt;ID&gt;</code> (2 years), used by Google Analytics 4 to distinguish visitors and group the pages of a visit.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>You can stay out of Google Analytics without losing anything on Arabia Expat: every visa guide, city page, and cost estimator works the same. Google offers an <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">opt-out add-on for desktop browsers</a>; alternatively, a content blocker or your browser's privacy settings can stop requests to google-analytics.com or refuse third-party cookies altogether.</p>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>Analytics recipients: Microsoft (Clarity) and Google Ireland Limited and Google LLC (Google Analytics 4), as described above.</p>
  <p>We may link to third-party websites (government portals, official sources) for reference purposes. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external websites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies.</p>

  <h2>Data Retention</h2>
  <p>Analytics data is retained according to Microsoft Clarity's standard retention policies. Google Analytics 4 data is retained for 14 months, as set on our property. We do not maintain separate databases of visitor information.</p>

  <h2>Your Rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Access information we hold about you</li>
    <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
    <li>Opt out of analytics tracking</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent for data processing</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>Arabia Expat is written for adults planning a move, such as job candidates, spouses, and parents arranging school places. Children under 16 are not its audience, and if we learn that a message came from a child we delete it.</p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page indicates when the policy was most recently revised.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy or your data, please contact us through our website.</p>
</GuideLayout>
